{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"article","sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/issuingsdkdocs\/gettingstarted"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/GettingStarted","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"title":"A Starting Guide (Sessions)","role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"IssuingSDKDocs"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Adyen Issuing SDK provides a suite of features for managing payment instruments in your iOS app:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Card Provisioning Sessions","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" — Add payment cards to Apple Wallet"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Card Sessions"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" — Securely reveal card details (PAN, CVC, expiry), reveal PIN, and change PIN (Work in Progress)"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This guide covers the common setup steps required for all SDK features.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Prerequisites","anchor":"Prerequisites"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Before you begin, you must obtain a certificate from Adyen. This certificate is required to initialize the SDK.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Embed the Certificate","anchor":"Embed-the-Certificate"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Take the certificate provided by Adyen and embed it directly into your app’s main bundle.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Fetch a Session Token","anchor":"Fetch-a-Session-Token"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All SDK features require a session token from the Adyen API. Your backend needs to fetch this token for the specific payment instruments."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Perform a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST"},{"type":"text","text":" request to the following endpoint:"}]},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Environment"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"URL"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Test","type":"text"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"https:\/\/test.adyen.com\/authe\/api\/v1\/sessions","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Live"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"https:\/\/authe-live.adyen.com\/authe\/api\/v1\/sessions","type":"codeVoice"}]}]]],"type":"table"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Headers:","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Content-Type: application\/json","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"X-API-Key: YOUR_API_KEY","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Body:","type":"text"}]}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"json","code":["{","    \"product\": \"platform\",","    \"policy\": {","        \"resources\": [","            {","                \"type\": \"paymentInstrument\",","                \"paymentInstrumentId\": \"...\"","            }","        ],","        \"roles\": [\"...\"]","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"aside","name":"Note","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The required ","type":"text"},{"code":"roles","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" depend on the SDK feature you are using. See the feature-specific documentation for details.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your backend should receive the session token and pass it to your iOS application."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Import the SDK","level":2,"anchor":"Import-the-SDK","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the appropriate import statements at the top of your Swift files:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import CardProvisioningSessions","import IssuingCommon"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This gives you access to all public types, including "},{"code":"TokenProviding","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"Configuration","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"code":"ProvisioningSession","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Note","style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Do not import ","type":"text"},{"code":"IssuingCore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" directly. It is an internal dependency that is required at link time but has no public API for integrators.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"text":"Implement a Token Provider","level":2,"anchor":"Implement-a-Token-Provider","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your app needs an object that conforms to the "},{"code":"TokenProviding","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol. This object is responsible for supplying the session token fetched in the previous step."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import IssuingCommon","","class TokenProvider: TokenProviding {","    func retrieveToken(for paymentInstrumentIds: Set<String>) async throws -> String {","        \/\/ Implement the logic to retrieve the session token for the given","        \/\/ payment instrument IDs from your backend and return it.","        let sessionToken = \"...\"","        return sessionToken","    }","}","","let tokenProvider = TokenProvider()"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Device Testing Requirements","level":2,"anchor":"Device-Testing-Requirements","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The SDK requires a "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Release build on a physical device","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" for full end-to-end functionality. Use TestFlight to distribute Release builds to testers. The iOS Simulator is suitable for UI development and integration work, but provisioning flows cannot complete on the Simulator."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Next Steps","level":2,"anchor":"Next-Steps","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Once you have completed the common setup, proceed to the feature-specific guide:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/CardProvisioningGuide","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — Understand the two provisioning approaches and choose the right one for your architecture"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/SessionsProvisioningGuide","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — Add cards to Apple Wallet using the session-based API (recommended)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/OfflineProvisioningGuide","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — Add cards to Apple Wallet with direct control over each provisioning step"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/CardSessionsGuide","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — Reveal card details, reveal PIN, change PIN (Work in Progress)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"t